<title>INDIA: Hindalco sees 97/988 operating profit at 40 pct.</title>
<headline>Hindalco sees 97/988 operating profit at 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest private aluminium marker, Hindalco Industries Ltd., said on Wednesday it expected its operating profit for the financial year 1997/98 (April-March) to be 40 percent.</p>
<p>Firm chairman Kumar Mangalam Birla made the remarks in reply to shareholder queries at the firm's annual general meeting.</p>
